* FD-18  Transconductance frequency response gm(f)
* OTA spec 3.2.2.1 (Fig. 35) with the Fig. 34 FD connection: AC 1 across the
* inputs, outputs returned to VCOM through RG = {{R_GM}} ohm; gm(f) = (Vop - Von)/RG.
* Copy L follows Fig. 35 as drawn: actual RL/CL load per output, a DC-only
* differential servo for bias, gm = |Vop - Von|/RL.
{{SEED_OPTION}}
.lib "{{MODEL_LIB}}" {{CORNER}}
{{MC_PARAM}}
.include "{{DUT_FILE}}"
.temp {{TEMP}}
.options reltol=1e-5 abstol=1e-15 vntol=1e-9
VDD vdd 0 {{VDD}}
VSS vss 0 0
IBIAS vdd ibias {{IBIAS}}
VCM vcm 0 {{VCM}}
R1 inp vcm {{R_NET}}
R2 vcm inn {{R_NET}}
VID inp inn DC 0 AC 1
XDUT vss ibias vdd vcmpin inp inn outp outn {{DUT}}
RVCM_DUT vcm vcmpin 1k
RGP outp vcm {{R_GM}}
RGN outn vcm {{R_GM}}
* Copy L: Fig. 35 as drawn
IBIASL vdd ibiasl {{IBIAS}}
EPL spl vcm onl opl 0.5
ENL snl vcm opl onl 0.5
LPL spl xpl 1G
CPL xpl 0 1G
LNL snl xnl 1G
CNL xnl 0 1G
VAPL inpl xpl DC 0 AC 0.5
VANL innl xnl DC 0 AC 0.5 180
XL vss ibiasl vdd vcmpin_l inpl innl opl onl {{DUT}}
RVCM_L vcm vcmpin_l 1k
RLPL opl vcm {{RL}}
CLPL opl 0 {{CL}}
RLNL onl vcm {{RL}}
CLNL onl 0 {{CL}}
.control
set filetype=ascii
ac dec 50 1 10G
write {{RAW}} v(outp) v(outn) v(opl) v(onl)
.endc
.end
